  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project 3.2: Urban Resilience Building through Adaptation and Inclusive Socioeconomic Empowerment (URBANISE)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The URBANISE project supports urban communities affected by drought, flooding, and conflict in Somalia.  The project implemented by Save the Children Denmark. 

To reduce the vulnerabilities of internally displaced persons (IDPs) and urban populations to climate change and enhance sustainable livelihoods, urban planning and durable solutions in urban and peri-urban areas, with a primary focus on transitioning populations to becoming economically resilient and self-reliant economic agents.</narrative>
  </description>
